    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3b5d86633acee96645aa9233a5936f56.avif?t=1596293150\" /></div><br><br><strong><i>Choose your gear wisely and make it from shelter to shelter. Your mood plays an important role in your survival. Pick up airdrops or cut down trees to get loot. Be careful of traps, rough weather conditions and wild animals that attack you. Hike on tons of procedural generated &quot;real-world GPX&quot; or fantasy trails.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Competition</strong></h2><i>Enjoy playing against computer or human controlled hikers.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock Inventory</strong></h2><i>Give your rucksack a new style with badges and make your character unique with a variety of hats.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Editor</strong></h2><i>Create unique trails yourself or import GPX files.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3b5d86633acee96645aa9233a5936f56.avif?t=1596293150\" /></div><br><br><strong><i>Choose your gear wisely and make it from shelter to shelter. Your mood plays an important role in your survival. Pick up airdrops or cut down trees to get loot. Be careful of traps, rough weather conditions and wild animals that attack you. Hike on tons of procedural generated &quot;real-world GPX&quot; or fantasy trails.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Competition</strong></h2><i>Enjoy playing against computer or human controlled hikers.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/16d48e80ab415cf8f50f270cff4c90d1.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock Inventory</strong></h2><i>Give your rucksack a new style with badges and make your character unique with a variety of hats.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/3f5020aa4bdc7e6ad3e233dd3dab9ba0.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Editor</strong></h2><i>Create unique trails yourself or import GPX files.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.poster.avif?t=1596293150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.webm?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/722290/extras/cd1b7a1a575f6c03b1bfc63c606e427e.mp4?t=1596293150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "HikeJam is a survival side-scroller. Go on a challenging journey and endure the harsh trail conditions in single or multiplayer. It's now your turn to rank up and become a thru-hiker.",
